# tkt runtime coordination state; canonical tickets are Markdown files.
.state/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.db
*.db-*
*.lock
*.tmp

# Derived docs-engine artifacts: regenerated from the ticket Markdown by
# every tkt mutation and by `tkt export sidebar`. Build output, not
# source -- the docs engine reads them from the working tree, and
# `tkt rev` excludes them from the corpus hash. Anchored to this
# directory so a ticket that happens to share a name is unaffected.
/_*
/index.md
/focus.md
/closed-tickets.md
